563	// TestCLIMisownedNodeFileIsRefused plants one node's complete, checksum-valid
564	// file under another node's name and checks the command line refuses to serve
565	// it as the wrong node's telemetry: health (plain and with a baseline),
566	// history and submit all fail non-zero with the reason on stderr, while the
567	// real owner keeps working.
